#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><title>
#: blfs-en/x/wm/fluxbox.xml:87
#, xml-text
msgid "Installation of Fluxbox"
msgstr "Instalação do Fluxbox"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/x/wm/fluxbox.xml:90
#, xml-text
msgid "First, fix a build failure when building with gcc-11.1 and later:"
msgstr ""
"Primeiro, corrija uma falha de construção ao construir com o gcc-11.1 e "
"posterior:"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><screen>
#: blfs-en/x/wm/fluxbox.xml:93
#, no-wrap, xml-text
msgid ""
"<userinput remap=\"pre\">sed -i '/text_prop.value &gt; 0/s/&gt;/!=/' "
"util/fluxbox-remote.cc</userinput>"
msgstr ""
"<userinput remap=\"pre\">sed -i '/text_prop.value &gt; 0/s/&gt;/!=/' "
"util/fluxbox-remote.cc</userinput>"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/x/wm/fluxbox.xml:96
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"Install <application>Fluxbox</application> by running the following "
"commands:"
msgstr ""
"Instale o &quot;<application>Fluxbox</application>&quot; executando os "
"seguintes comandos:"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><screen>
#: blfs-en/x/wm/fluxbox.xml:100
#, no-wrap, xml-text
msgid ""
"<userinput>./configure --prefix=/usr &amp;&amp;\n"
"make</userinput>"
msgstr ""
"<userinput>./configure --prefix=/usr &amp;&amp;\n"
"make</userinput>"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/x/wm/fluxbox.xml:104
#, xml-text
msgid "This package does not have a working test suite."
msgstr "Esse pacote não tem uma suíte funcional de teste."

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/x/wm/fluxbox.xml:108
#, xml-text
msgid "Now, as the <systemitem class=\"username\">root</systemitem> user:"
msgstr "Agora, como o(a) usante <systemitem class=\"username\">root</systemitem>:"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><screen>
#: blfs-en/x/wm/fluxbox.xml:111
#, no-wrap, xml-text
msgid "<userinput>make install</userinput>"
msgstr "<userinput>make install</userinput>"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><title>
#: blfs-en/x/wm/fluxbox.xml:116
#, xml-text
msgid "Configuring Fluxbox"
msgstr "Configurando o Fluxbox"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><sect3><title>
#: blfs-en/x/wm/fluxbox.xml:119
#, xml-text
msgid "Config Files"
msgstr "Arquivos de Configuração"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><sect3><para>
#: blfs-en/x/wm/fluxbox.xml:122
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"<filename>~/.fluxbox/init</filename>, <filename>~/.fluxbox/keys</filename>, "
"and <filename>~/.fluxbox/menu</filename>"
msgstr ""
"<filename>~/.fluxbox/init</filename>, <filename>~/.fluxbox/keys</filename> e"
" <filename>~/.fluxbox/menu</filename>"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><sect3><indexterm><primary>
#: blfs-en/x/wm/fluxbox.xml:128
#, xml-text
msgid "~/.fluxbox/init"
msgstr "~/.fluxbox/init"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><sect3><indexterm><primary>
#: blfs-en/x/wm/fluxbox.xml:132
#, xml-text
msgid "~/.fluxbox/keys"
msgstr "~/.fluxbox/keys"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><sect3><indexterm><primary>
#: blfs-en/x/wm/fluxbox.xml:136
#, xml-text
msgid "~/.fluxbox/menu"
msgstr "~/.fluxbox/menu"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><sect3><title>
#: blfs-en/x/wm/fluxbox.xml:142
#, xml-text
msgid "Configuration Information"
msgstr "Informação de Configuração"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><sect3><para>
#: blfs-en/x/wm/fluxbox.xml:145
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"If <application>Fluxbox</application> is the only Window Manager you want to"
" use, you can start it with an <filename>.xinitrc</filename> file in your "
"home folder. Be sure to backup your current <filename>.xinitrc</filename> "
"before proceeding."
msgstr ""
"Se o &quot;<application>Fluxbox</application>&quot; for o único Gerenciador "
"de Janelas que você quer usar, [então] você pode iniciá-lo com um arquivo "
"&quot;<filename>.xinitrc</filename>&quot; em tua pasta inicial. Certifique-"
"se de produzir uma cópia de segurança do teu "
"&quot;<filename>.xinitrc</filename>&quot; atual antes de continuar."

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><sect3><indexterm><primary>
#: blfs-en/x/wm/fluxbox.xml:152
#, xml-text
msgid "~/.xinitrc"
msgstr "~/.xinitrc"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><sect3><screen>
#: blfs-en/x/wm/fluxbox.xml:155
#, no-wrap, xml-text
msgid "<userinput>echo startfluxbox &gt; ~/.xinitrc</userinput>"
msgstr "<userinput>echo startfluxbox &gt; ~/.xinitrc</userinput>"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><sect3><para>
#: blfs-en/x/wm/fluxbox.xml:158
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"Or alternatively, if you use a login manager like <xref linkend=\"gdm\"/> or"
" <xref linkend=\"lightdm\"/>, and would like to be able to choose "
"<application>Fluxbox</application> at the login prompt, create a "
"<filename>fluxbox.desktop</filename> file. As <systemitem "
"class=\"username\">root</systemitem>:"
msgstr ""
"Ou, alternativamente, se você usa um gerenciador de &quot;login&quot; como o"
" &quot;<xref linkend=\"gdm\"/>&quot; ou o &quot;<xref "
"linkend=\"lightdm\"/>&quot; e gostaria de poder escolher o "
"&quot;<application>Fluxbox</application>&quot; na solicitação de "
"&quot;login&quot;, [então] crie um arquivo "
"&quot;<filename>fluxbox.desktop</filename>&quot;. Como &quot;<systemitem "
"class=\"username\">root</systemitem>&quot;:"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><sect3><screen>
#: blfs-en/x/wm/fluxbox.xml:165
#, no-wrap, xml-text
msgid ""
"<userinput>mkdir -pv /usr/share/xsessions &amp;&amp;\n"
"cat &gt; /usr/share/xsessions/fluxbox.desktop &lt;&lt; \"EOF\"\n"
"<literal>[Desktop Entry]\n"
"Encoding=UTF-8\n"
"Name=Fluxbox\n"
"Comment=This session logs you into Fluxbox\n"
"Exec=startfluxbox\n"
"Type=Application</literal>\n"
"EOF</userinput>"
msgstr ""
"<userinput>mkdir -pv /usr/share/xsessions &amp;&amp;\n"
"cat &gt; /usr/share/xsessions/fluxbox.desktop &lt;&lt; \"EOF\"\n"
"<literal>[Desktop Entry]\n"
"Encoding=UTF-8\n"
"Name=Fluxbox\n"
"Comment=Esta sessão te conecta ao Fluxbox\n"
"Exec=startfluxbox\n"
"Type=Application</literal>\n"
"EOF</userinput>"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><sect3><para>
#: blfs-en/x/wm/fluxbox.xml:176
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"If you didn't install <xref linkend=\"gdm\"/> or <xref linkend=\"lightdm\"/>"
" in <filename class='directory'>/usr</filename>, then change that command to"
" fit the prefix you chose."
msgstr ""
"Se você não instalou o &quot;<xref linkend=\"gdm\"/>&quot; ou o &quot;<xref "
"linkend=\"lightdm\"/>&quot; no &quot;<filename "
"class='directory'>/usr</filename>&quot;, então mude esse comando para "
"ajustar o prefixo que você escolher."

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><sect3><para>
#: blfs-en/x/wm/fluxbox.xml:182
#, xml-text
msgid "Now create the <application>Fluxbox</application> configuration files:"
msgstr ""
"Agora crie os arquivos de configuração do "
"&quot;<application>Fluxbox</application>&quot;:"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><sect3><screen>
#: blfs-en/x/wm/fluxbox.xml:185
#, no-wrap, xml-text
msgid ""
"<userinput>mkdir -v ~/.fluxbox &amp;&amp;\n"
"cp -v /usr/share/fluxbox/init ~/.fluxbox/init &amp;&amp;\n"
"cp -v /usr/share/fluxbox/keys ~/.fluxbox/keys</userinput>"
msgstr ""
"<userinput>mkdir -v ~/.fluxbox &amp;&amp;\n"
"cp -v /usr/share/fluxbox/init ~/.fluxbox/init &amp;&amp;\n"
"cp -v /usr/share/fluxbox/keys ~/.fluxbox/keys</userinput>"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><sect3><para>
#: blfs-en/x/wm/fluxbox.xml:190
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"To generate the application menu, first you may wish to run "
"<command>fluxbox-generate_menu -h</command>, in order to choose any "
"<replaceable>&lt;user_options&gt;</replaceable>, then issue:"
msgstr ""
"Para gerar o menu da aplicação, primeiro você possivelmente deseje executar "
"o &quot;<command>fluxbox-generate_menu -h</command>&quot;, para a finalidade"
" de escolher quaisquer "
"<replaceable>&lt;opções_de_usuário(a)&gt;</replaceable>; então emita:"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><sect3><screen>
#: blfs-en/x/wm/fluxbox.xml:195
#, no-wrap, xml-text
msgid ""
"<userinput>cd ~/.fluxbox &amp;&amp;\n"
"fluxbox-generate_menu <replaceable>&lt;user_options&gt;</replaceable></userinput>"
msgstr ""
"<userinput>cd ~/.fluxbox &amp;&amp;\n"
"fluxbox-generate_menu <replaceable>&lt;opções_de_usuário(a)&gt;</replaceable></userinput>"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><sect3><para>
#: blfs-en/x/wm/fluxbox.xml:199
#, xml-text
msgid "Alternately, copy a pregenerated menu:"
msgstr "Alternativamente, copie um menu pré gerado:"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><sect3><screen>
#: blfs-en/x/wm/fluxbox.xml:202
#, no-wrap, xml-text
msgid "<userinput>cp -v /usr/share/fluxbox/menu ~/.fluxbox/menu</userinput>"
msgstr "<userinput>cp -v /usr/share/fluxbox/menu ~/.fluxbox/menu</userinput>"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><sect3><para>
#: blfs-en/x/wm/fluxbox.xml:205
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"Menu items are added by editing <filename>~/.fluxbox/menu</filename>.  The "
"syntax is explained on the <command>fluxbox</command> man page."
msgstr ""
"Itens de menu são adicionados editando-se "
"&quot;<filename>~/.fluxbox/menu</filename>&quot;. A sintaxe é explicada na "
"página de manual do &quot;<command>fluxbox</command>&quot;."

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><sect3><para>
#: blfs-en/x/wm/fluxbox.xml:210
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"If you want to use an image as your desktop background, copy the theme you "
"like into <filename class='directory'>~/.fluxbox</filename>.  Then add a "
"line to make it use the correct image. In the following command, change "
"<replaceable>&lt;theme&gt;</replaceable> for the name of the theme you want "
"and change <replaceable>&lt;/path/to/nice/image.ext&gt;</replaceable> to "
"point to the actual image you want to use, where "
"<replaceable>ext</replaceable> must be <literal>xpm</literal>, if <xref "
"linkend=\"imlib2\"/> is not installed to allow other image formats."
msgstr ""
"Se quiser usar uma imagem como plano de fundo da tua área de trabalho, copie"
" o tema que você gostar em <filename "
"class='directory'>~/.fluxbox</filename>. Em seguida, adicione uma linha para"
" fazê-lo usar a imagem correta. No comando a seguir, mude "
"<replaceable>&lt;tema&gt;</replaceable> para o nome do tema desejado e mude "
"<replaceable>&lt;/caminho/para/atraente/imagem.ext&gt;</replaceable> para "
"apontar para a imagem atual que você deseja usar, onde "
"<replaceable>ext</replaceable> precisa ser <literal>xpm</literal>, se o "
"<xref linkend=\"imlib2\"/> não estiver instalado para permitir outros "
"formatos de imagem."

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><sect3><screen>
#: blfs-en/x/wm/fluxbox.xml:221
#, no-wrap, xml-text
msgid ""
"<userinput>cp -r /usr/share/fluxbox/styles/&lt;theme&gt; ~/.fluxbox/theme &amp;&amp;\n"
"\n"
"sed -i 's,\\(session.styleFile:\\).*,\\1 ~/.fluxbox/theme,' ~/.fluxbox/init &amp;&amp;\n"
"\n"
"[ -f ~/.fluxbox/theme ] &amp;&amp;\n"
"echo \"background.pixmap: &lt;/path/to/nice/image.ext&gt;\" >> ~/.fluxbox/theme ||\n"
"[ -d ~/.fluxbox/theme ] &amp;&amp;\n"
"echo \"background.pixmap: &lt;/path/to/nice/image.ext&gt;\" >> ~/.fluxbox/theme/theme.cfg</userinput>"
msgstr ""
"<userinput>cp -r /usr/share/fluxbox/styles/&lt;tema&gt; ~/.fluxbox/theme &amp;&amp;\n"
"\n"
"sed -i 's,\\(session.styleFile:\\).*,\\1 ~/.fluxbox/theme,' ~/.fluxbox/init &amp;&amp;\n"
"\n"
"[ -f ~/.fluxbox/theme ] &amp;&amp;\n"
"echo \"background.pixmap: &lt;/caminho/para/atraente/imagem.ext&gt;\" >> ~/.fluxbox/theme ||\n"
"[ -d ~/.fluxbox/theme ] &amp;&amp;\n"
"echo \"background.pixmap: &lt;/caminho/para/atraente/imagem.ext&gt;\" >> ~/.fluxbox/theme/theme.cfg</userinput>"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><sect3><para>
#: blfs-en/x/wm/fluxbox.xml:231
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"In some locales the font specified in the theme may not contain the needed "
"characters. This results in menus with blank items. You can fix this by "
"editing <filename>~/.fluxbox/theme</filename> with a text editor and "
"altering it so that it names a suitable font."
msgstr ""
"Em algumas localidades, a fonte especificada no tema possivelmente não "
"contenha os caracteres necessários. Isso resulta em menus com itens em "
"branco. Você consegue corrigir isso editando "
"&quot;<filename>~/.fluxbox/theme</filename>&quot; com um editor de texto e "
"alterando-o, de forma que ele nomeie uma fonte adequada."

